UID:EokAUgMildEpk1vvaRazp
SUMMARY:Meet the Mowers
DTSTAMP:20260722T105542Z
DTSTART:20260807T100000Z
DESCRIPTION:Free\, Members onlyNo registration necessaryAll ages \n\n\n\nHo
	uston Arboretum Members are the G.O.A.T! Join us on the Event Lawn for thi
	s Members-only appreciation event is designed as a relaxed\, drop-in exper
	ience. Members can observe the goats while enjoying the Trail Mix Grazing 
	Station\, a self-serve snack station with assorted trail mix ingredients\,
	 and informal engagement with staff and volunteers. \n\n\n\nAlthough petti
	ng is not allowed\, you’ll have plenty of chances to capture fun selfies w
	ith our furry visitors before they embark on their next adventure! \n\n\n\
	n\nbecome a member\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis event will be held rain or shine 
	and will be entirely outdoors. Please dress for the weather. \n\n\n\n\n\n\
	n\n\n2026 goat map\n\nhttps://houstonarboretum.org/event/meet-the-mowers/\
	n\nFrom Houston Arboretum & Nature Center
